{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311120","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1231112001:1":{"text":"가타 말하는 건가? 러스트 항을 이미 떠났지.","source_cn":"你是说葛塔吗？他离开锈锚港了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2C219275CFB5519","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231112002:1":{"text":"항구의 봉쇄가 풀린 지 얼마 지나지 않아서 그는 짐을 챙겨 배에 올랐어.","source_cn":"港口解开封锁不久后，他就背着行李上了船。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68360D105921CD01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231112003:1":{"text":"이 낚시 포인트도 그가 알려준 건데, 매일 물고기를 가득 낚고 있지.","source_cn":"这个钓点就是他在离开前告诉我的，我每次都收获满满。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70E72AACF892A09B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231112004:1":{"text":"그의 앞길이 전복 사고 없이 평탄하기를 바라.","source_cn":"希望他的旅途一路顺风，永不倾覆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1527E9F526331F92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:渔夫奇科夫":{"text":"어부 치코프","source":"渔夫奇科夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}